&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;C&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;oupang is an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, or gender (including pregnancy, gender identity, gender expression, sexual orientation, transgender status), national origin, age, disability, medical condition, HIV/AIDS or Hepatitis C status, marital status, military or veteran status, use of a trained dog guide or service animal, political activities, or affiliations, citizenship, or any other characteristic or class protected by the laws or regulations in the locations where we operate. If you need&amp;nbsp;assistance&amp;nbsp;and/or reasonable accommodation in the recruiting process due to a disability, please contact us at&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:usrecruiting@coupang.com&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;usrecruiting@coupang.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

alphapartners-coupang:greenhouse:7919377.descriptionHtml:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Company Introduction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We exist to wow our customers. We know we’re doing the right thing when we hear our customers say, “How did we ever live without Coupang?” Born out of an obsession to make shopping, eating, and living easier than ever, we are collectively disrupting the multi-billion-dollar commerce industry from the ground up and establishing an unparalleled reputation for being leading and reliable force in South Korean commerce.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We are proud to have the best of both worlds — a startup culture with the resources of a large global public company. This fuels us to continue our growth and launch new services at the speed we have been since our inception. We are all entrepreneurs surrounded by opportunities to drive new initiatives and innovations. At our core, we are bold and ambitious people that like to get our hands dirty and make a hands-on impact. At Coupang, you will see yourself, your colleagues, your team, and the company grow every day.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our mission to build the future of commerce is real. We push the boundaries of what’s possible to solve problems and break traditional tradeoffs. Join Coupang now to create an epic experience in this always-on, high-tech, and hyper-connected world.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Role Overview&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;_2e99433a _082f4705&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As a Director of Product, you will own and drive your product area from start to finish. You will identify opportunities, formulate strategies and the execution plan, align stakeholders, socialize your plan, define success metrics, and finally implement, launch and measure the impact. You will independently define and own the KPIs that drive the OKRs in your area.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will also own program &amp;amp; operations&#39; teams in your org which will be responsible for cross-border supply chain execution - including but not limited to : driving partnerships with service providers, understanding seller experience supply chain needs and opportunities to innovate, and solving recurring issues that sellers might be facing using strong process or product interventions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a strong sense of judgment and a mindset that continuously questions the status quo. You have the swagger to work with various stakeholders to bring them together around common objectives and then lead them to execution. You enjoy working with and analyzing data to develop insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Successful applicants will love delving deep into data, have strong analytical skills, outstanding communication tactics, and be comfortable with executive-level evaluations. You will be at ease engaging with technical software development teams and flourish in a collaborative, creative, analytical, and quick-paced atmosphere. You should possess the knowledge and skills necessary to create documents for top executives. This is a high-profile role that will interact with people at all levels of the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research: Analyze the competitive landscape, identify areas where the overall experience may be improved and gather product requirements from customers and business stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategy and communication: To ensure that projects run well, reach an understanding with stakeholders regarding the specifics and timelines of the strategy. You need to craft a story around your ideas and execution plan and drive alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Roadmap management: oversee the product roadmap and assign priorities depending on the impact to the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute: Manage every step of the product lifecycle, including use case definition, success metrics, solution discovery, strategy development, launch, A/B testing, impact analysis, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor: Train up-and-coming product, program and operations managers and assist them in carrying out the crucial tasks assigned as part of the team&#39;s overall OKRs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate: Establish strong working relationships with stakeholders from the customer, business, and UX design communities to guarantee planned product features are delivered and OKRs are met.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Earn trust: Do all the above in a manner that others look up to you and want to work with/ for you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Basic Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;_2e99433a _082f4705&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;13+ years in a senior position inside a business or in product management, operations/program management, strategic consulting, pricing, or revenue management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;leadership experience with a history of launching and managing products and dealing with ambiguity and complexity and running regular metric reviews and mechanisms to deepdive for growth blockers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong verbal and written communication abilities. Ability to collaborate with both technical and non-technical people and present with assurance to all levels of the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise presenting insights to leadership and other stakeholders after evaluating huge datasets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of leading company and roadmap strategy while handling conflicting goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of a product&#39;s tradeoffs and feature delivery from beginning to end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualification:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;_2e99433a _082f4705&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MBA from Top ranked Business school&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to deal with ambiguity in a fast-paced work environment with changing priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-depth expertise in fulfillment and warehouse services as well as online retail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Bias for action and getting results attitude.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bilingual Chinese - English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
