&lt;p data-start=&quot;246&quot; data-end=&quot;279&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;246&quot; data-end=&quot;279&quot;&gt;Be the difference. Be BAYADA.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;281&quot; data-end=&quot;607&quot;&gt;BAYADA Home Health Care is seeking compassionate and dependable &lt;strong data-start=&quot;345&quot; data-end=&quot;428&quot;&gt;Certified Home Health Aides for Live-In assignments throughout Somerset County.&lt;/strong&gt; Live-In caregivers provide dedicated one on one support to clients in their homes, helping them remain safe, comfortable, and independent while building meaningful relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;609&quot; data-end=&quot;726&quot;&gt;Live-In care offers stable income, consistent hours, and the opportunity to make a lasting impact in a client’s life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;728&quot; data-end=&quot;748&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;728&quot; data-end=&quot;748&quot;&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;750&quot; data-end=&quot;1162&quot;&gt;• Provide personal care and assistance with activities of daily living&lt;br data-start=&quot;820&quot; data-end=&quot;823&quot;&gt;• Support mobility, safety, and comfort throughout the day&lt;br data-start=&quot;881&quot; data-end=&quot;884&quot;&gt;• Assist with meal preparation, light housekeeping, and companionship&lt;br data-start=&quot;953&quot; data-end=&quot;956&quot;&gt;• Follow an individualized care plan and monitor for changes in condition&lt;br data-start=&quot;1029&quot; data-end=&quot;1032&quot;&gt;• Maintain a respectful, calm, and supportive care environment&lt;br data-start=&quot;1094&quot; data-end=&quot;1097&quot;&gt;• Communicate regularly with BAYADA’s clinical and office teams&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1164&quot; data-end=&quot;1191&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1164&quot; data-end=&quot;1191&quot;&gt;What We Are Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1193&quot; data-end=&quot;1522&quot;&gt;• Active New Jersey Certified Home Health Aide (CHHA) license&lt;br data-start=&quot;1254&quot; data-end=&quot;1257&quot;&gt;• Willingness to work live-in caregiver assignments in Somerset County&lt;br data-start=&quot;1327&quot; data-end=&quot;1330&quot;&gt;• Compassionate and patient focused approach to care&lt;br data-start=&quot;1382&quot; data-end=&quot;1385&quot;&gt;• Reliability and professionalism in a one on one home care setting&lt;br data-start=&quot;1452&quot; data-end=&quot;1455&quot;&gt;• Ability to build strong relationships with clients and families&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1524&quot; data-end=&quot;1565&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1524&quot; data-end=&quot;1565&quot;&gt;Why You Will Love Working With BAYADA&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1567&quot; data-end=&quot;1867&quot;&gt;• Consistent live-in assignments with steady income&lt;br data-start=&quot;1618&quot; data-end=&quot;1621&quot;&gt;• One on one care so you can focus fully on your client&lt;br data-start=&quot;1676&quot; data-end=&quot;1679&quot;&gt;• Paid training and ongoing clinical support&lt;br data-start=&quot;1723&quot; data-end=&quot;1726&quot;&gt;• Opportunities for long-term placements and schedule stability&lt;br data-start=&quot;1789&quot; data-end=&quot;1792&quot;&gt;• A trusted organization built on Compassion, Excellence, and Reliability&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1869&quot; data-end=&quot;2037&quot;&gt;At BAYADA, our caregivers are the heart of everything we do. If you are looking for meaningful work where your care truly makes a difference, we would love to meet you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2039&quot; data-end=&quot;2111&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2039&quot; data-end=&quot;2111&quot;&gt;Apply today to join our team serving clients across Somerset County.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;As an accredited, regulated, certified, and licensed home health care provider, BAYADA complies with all state/local mandates.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
