&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BAYADA Home Health Care&lt;/strong&gt; is looking for a compassionate and dedicated Weekend Baylor Registered Nurse, Full Time to join our team. This office services our adult and geriatric clients on a &lt;strong&gt;per visit basis&lt;/strong&gt; throughout &lt;strong&gt;Montgomery County and parts of Philadelphia.&amp;nbsp; Weekend schedule would be Friday - Sunday OR Saturday - Monday.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
